---
import ReportLayout from '../layouts/ReportLayout.astro';
import StatusPill from '../components/report/StatusPill.astro';
---
<ReportLayout title="Hardware" description="The Open Smart Desk sensor and E003 carrier-board review state."><section class="report-container py-16 md:py-24"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-green">Hardware appendix</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4"><h1 class="text-4xl text-gray-100 sm:text-5xl">Sensor and carrier board</h1><StatusPill state="in review" /></div><div class="prose prose-invert mt-10 max-w-[75ch] prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:text-gray-100 prose-p:text-gray-300 prose-p:leading-8"><p>E003 contains a generated review pack for four candidate board variants. Local contract and artifact checks pass, but that is not fabrication approval.</p><h2>Open review gates</h2><ul><li>Capture calibrated dimensions and pad maps for the received modules.</li><li>Characterize the breakout power rail, I2C voltage domain and pull-ups.</li><li>Shorten and inspect the routing with explicit layer intent.</li><li>Obtain a qualified external electronics review.</li></ul><p>See the <a href="/versions" class="report-link">version log</a> for why the current direction keeps the decision engine on the computer.</p></div></section></ReportLayout>
